    {
      "id": "blk_1969b9f1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "已知，在一次悲鸣中，索拉里斯的地轴与磁极产生了偏移。当拉海洛成为新的极点时，第一次灭绝随之发生，大量近地卫星与空间站也坠落在冰原之上。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bb7b25d5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "部分坠落的空间站短暂地成为罗伊人最初的庇护所，帮助部分罗伊先民在剧烈的气候变化中幸存。而这些空间站与卫星中残留的数据，成为了他们对计算与规律的启蒙。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9d4e5ebd",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b8be2282",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在这些年的探索中，大部分坠落的空间站和卫星残骸都已被定位并发掘。部分空间站受虚质磁暴影响，数据完全无法恢复，但仍有相当数量的空间站留存着珍贵的数据，成为照亮未来者的火炬。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a7dffac3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
